472	      </p>
473	      <p class="callout">
474	        <strong>Disabled contrast:</strong> Disabled states are exempt from WCAG 1.4.3 contrast requirements by spec. The washed-out lime tint on the primary communicates inactivity while staying visually connected to the active state. Avoid using disabled buttons without nearby copy explaining why the action is unavailable.
